{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17979","headline":"天星送杨凝郎中贺正 · 韩愈","name":"天星送杨凝郎中贺正","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天星牢落鸡喔咿，仆夫起餐车载脂。\n正当穷冬寒未已，借问君子行安之。\n会朝元正无不至，受命上宰须及期。\n侍从近臣有虚位，公今此去归何时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}